  "id": "fss",
  "term": "FSS",
  "definition": "FSS stands for functional somatic symptoms: physical complaints that are often not explained by a clearly defined organic disease. The term refers to bodily distress linked to complex causes and changes in bodily functioning rather than structure, and it can also occur alongside physical illness.",
